        "Content": "Gas Fired Central Heating \r\nCar Parking Space and Private Storage Shed Included\r\n1st Floor Apartment \r\nHighly Sought After Development\r\n2 Double Bedrooms\r\nEasy Access to Dublin\r\nManagement Fees Approx €900"
      },
